  "result": "`npm test` passes now: all 243 tests, with no changes to the tests. There were two bugs in `src/`:\n\n1. **`src/cart.js`**: `total()` added tax first and then took the discount off the taxed amount. The code comment says the discount should come off the pre-tax subtotal, so I swapped the order. For example, a 100 subtotal with a 20 fixed discount and 10% tax now comes to 88 instead of 90.\n2. **`src/discount.js`**: a fixed discount larger than the amount gave a negative total (-14.5 in the test). It now stops at zero with `Math.max(0, amount - discount.value)`.",
